# Locally cloned or linked third-party repos. AdvTrajectoryPrediction and V2X-Real
# are symlinks to a checkout outside the build context, which Docker cannot follow;
# the Dockerfile clones them itself via WITH_GRIP / WITH_V2XREAL. third_party/CARLA
# holds the PythonAPI agents extracted from the CARLA image and is host-specific.
